{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_8001_p", "source_sha256": "29bc6083cc87f73e49d769b0bca8c967221e6896465bef9751842f3f7fb194f2", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画。\n恵美は『魅惑の舞姫』というテーマで撮影する）", "zh": "（偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真特辑。\n惠将以“魅惑的舞姬”为主题进行拍摄）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_8002_020meg", "source_sha256": "d1b30353e46c12ec73c5a9f583a300357add7ae06d94118e4b77a947ebfcbdcc", "ja": "ナイトプールって、いつ来てもアガるね～♪\nしかも今日は一味違った衣装だし！　にゃはは♪", "zh": "夜间泳池不管什么时候来都让人兴奋呢～♪\n而且今天还是风格特别不一样的服装！喵哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_8003_p", "source_sha256": "ab9cc2f2eb833554871137a425777cec518185e904d52a0804332d8e3b9aee15", "ja": "そうだな。派手な場所と清楚な衣装のギャップで\n見た人を魅了する……って感じだけど。いけそうか？", "zh": "是啊。用华丽场所和清纯服装之间的反差来吸引看到的人……大概就是这种感觉。你能做到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_8004_020meg", "source_sha256": "99defb4e9919577786cfbcebb4b56f8dd041375fe3ecc9180905389f9373485d", "ja": "もちろん！　……あれ？　ポーズとか清楚っぽい方が\nいい？　んー、ナイトプールで清楚かぁ……。", "zh": "当然！……咦？是摆出更清纯一点的姿势比较好？嗯——在夜间泳池里走清纯风啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_8005_020meg", "source_sha256": "fd726660021d9f03b637020588cd91935135ec60cfa8cd9d3d391e5aaf3681e7", "ja": "でも清楚すぎると浮いちゃうし……。\nちょっと待って。このテーマ、めっちゃ難しいかも！？", "zh": "可是太过清纯的话也会显得格格不入……等一下，这个主题好像真的很难啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_8006_020meg", "source_sha256": "3eaf57ed6d22b4c3ebfed80addfb45bbe5f5be411b4ea610d122be48587d938c", "ja": "{$P$}！\nアタシ、どうしたらいい……？", "zh": "{$P$}！\n我该怎么办才好……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_8007_p", "source_sha256": "717997f00c9fc5dcd30254802dcaed9b9512eb4823c70a107bd729f66c7f2a05", "ja": "うーん、そうだな……。", "zh": "唔～这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_8008", "source_sha256": "2dbc14dbbec1ef9920457d3009c297a8eea9ba53b52c48b68ebb3730dfbcf148", "ja": "いつも通りでいい", "zh": "和平常一样就行了", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
