{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_8100_p", "source_sha256": "5b04b2d7898a522608c2b1a85a99e86f2a86618cc42be5f7864f354f7baec325", "ja": "いつも通り、自然な恵美でいてくれればいいよ。\n清楚感は、衣装で十分出ているからな。", "zh": "只要和平常一样，保持自然的惠美就好了。\n清纯感的话，服装本身就已经表现得足够充分了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_8101_020meg", "source_sha256": "8ba0b8c4695f078eb741763bd5c27491dd32ca3db0bfee2b1bfd453a11ba050e", "ja": "ホント！？　そんなこと言われると、\nふつうに楽しんじゃうけど……それでいいってこと？", "zh": "真的！？你都这么说了，我可就真的要享受起来了……这样真的没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_8102_p", "source_sha256": "28e015c7675768ab30e39d27b2ad593ddac5d7751c7fa8c2a4412e8976def699", "ja": "ああ！　存分に楽しんでくれ！", "zh": "啊！尽情享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_8103_020meg", "source_sha256": "cc19ccc3d3d8a46f326f49d1b98cc7b4c6f6e482d82bae2e6319472dfe3eccbc", "ja": "やったぁ～！　そんじゃ、アゲアゲで遊んじゃうよ～！\n{$P$}、楽しい仕事ありがとねっ♪", "zh": "太棒啦～！那我就嗨翻全场，好好玩一场咯～！\n{$P$}，谢谢你安排这么开心的工作♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_8200_p", "source_sha256": "2e3d71b3a0c7856231b46c6aefdbd90760e279b60ed3b31b705c7ca8c8422078", "ja": "むしろ、セクシー路線でいってみるのも\n面白いかもしれないな。場所的にも合いそうだ。", "zh": "反而走性感路线试一试，\n或许也挺有意思的。而且跟这里的地点也很搭。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_8201_020meg", "source_sha256": "9ee1d980b3ad415f89043d2b3d953e22fc359ec4abf8bda8a2e248e3b41c9816", "ja": "なるほど……セクシーかぁ。\nまあ、グラビアだもんね。わかったよ！", "zh": "原来如此……性感路线啊。\n不过，毕竟是写真嘛。明白啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_8202_020meg", "source_sha256": "e883defb716c26d1fdbcf0ebd917b7964623fd4aeb3e2c42f2ec607540c92327", "ja": "「うっふ～ん♪　ユ・ウ・ワ・ク・しちゃうゾ♪」\nにゃはは、冗談冗談。本番はバッチリ決めるからね♪", "zh": "“嗯哼～♪　来・诱・惑・你・咯♪”\n喵哈哈，开玩笑的啦。正式开拍时我肯定会好好表现的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_8300_p", "source_sha256": "d2dda00fdcd044e50e8017d687850fb18f137d6ddffe010325bcb384cfa8476d", "ja": "清楚といっても色々だが……\n少し恥じらうだけでも、いい感じになると思うんだ！", "zh": "虽说清纯也有很多种……但我觉得哪怕只是稍微流露出一点羞涩，也会很有感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_8301_020meg", "source_sha256": "1f767fa7f5c11af448725a97e36922cd3849795bb6a023e1cd80d1dcc86add27", "ja": "恥じらいか……。あんまりピンとこないかも？\nだって何にも恥ずかしいことないし。", "zh": "害羞啊……我可能不太能理解？\n因为又没有什么好害羞的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_020meg_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_020meg_8302_020meg", "source_sha256": "5e5e5e3ca70c637cc3555060c4203843280c7df21204b7db64992e38dade6901", "ja": "まあ、テーマ的にそっちの方がいいってことだよね？\n……うん、割り切ってやってみるよ！", "zh": "嗯，按主题来说，选择那个方向更合适，对吧？\n……好，我会想开点试试！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
